  "description": "*\"This is Sparrow Tour, a saltwater fish processing specialist.\"*\n\nOne day, Baek Han joins a suspicious company that hunts saltwater fish. Saltwater fish are monsters created by humans in the past, preying on human life. Saltwater fish, preying on human life, are said to lurk throughout the country. This Korean-style fantasy adventure follows Baek Han on a journey across the country, following tales and legends to catch them.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
